C>` next to `-Wl,-reexport_library,<foo>`, and add `foo.TOC` to the target's inputs? Then…"]],0,1097],[8680380,20755,1,0.174,0.115,[[32,0]],[],0,1098],[8679840,20755,4,0.436,0.265,[[1,234]],[["649dede0_833fe9b9",3,0,1,"Take this issue?"]],0,1099]]}